[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0010","text":"……嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0020","text":"……好厉害……\n这幅画……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0030","text":"对吧！\n说实话主题什么的我不太懂……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0040","text":"但用色真的好漂亮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0050","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0070","text":"看到这样的画，就会想好多好多……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0080","text":"我也是……\n……作者的心情之类的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0090","text":"他是带着怎样的心情\n涂上这些颜色的呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_02_0100","text":"…………"}]
